# Tiny Pyramid Wireframe
# 5 Vertices, 8 Edges

# Vertices (x, y, z)
# The base corners (y = -0.5)
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
# The apex/top point (y = 0.5)
v  0.0  0.5  0.0

# Edges (Lines connecting vertex indices)
# Base lines (Square)
l 1 2
l 2 3
l 3 4
l 4 1

# Side lines (Connecting base to apex)
l 1 5
l 2 5
l 3 5
l 4 5